---
// Hero component - Focused on Talisay Integrated School teachers and top RMS features
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-36 lg:pb-28">
  <!-- Glowing Background Orbs & Radial Gradients matching app screenshots -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
    <div class="absolute left-1/2 -top-32 h-[550px] w-[850px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#16a34a]/25 via-[#15803d]/10 to-transparent blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-[-10%] top-1/4 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-[#f59e0b]/10 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute left-[-10%] bottom-10 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-[#22c55e]/10 blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Hero Header / Intro -->
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">

      <!-- Official School Identity Pill -->
      <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-[#2a4c37] bg-[#112017]/90 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#a7f3d0]">
        <img
          src="/tis_logo.png"
          alt="TIS Logo"
          class="h-5 w-5 object-contain"
          width="20"
          height="20"
        />
        <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">Talisay Integrated School</span>
        <span class="text-slate-500">•</span>
        <span class="text-slate-300">Tiaong, Quezon</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline-flex rounded-full bg-[#16a34a]/20 border border-[#16a34a]/40 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-[#4ade80]">
          Old Documents Archive (2021 Onwards)
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Headline -->
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl leading-[1.08]">
        Records Management System <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        for <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#4ade80] via-[#22c55e] to-[#f59e0b] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Old Documents (2021 Onwards).</span>
      </h1>

      <!-- Subtitle -->
      <p class="mt-6 text-base text-slate-300 sm:text-lg sm:leading-8 font-normal max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Built specifically for Talisay Integrated School to manage and register student basic information from historical documents dated <strong>2021 onwards</strong>. Utilizing <strong>SF-10 and SF-9</strong> documents offers the most efficient method to add basic learner profiles into your local school records—this is <strong>basic registration of basic information</strong>, not enrollment, with zero grade tracking.
      </p>

      <!-- Action Buttons -->
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="#downloads"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-xl bg-[#16a34a] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md shadow-[#16a34a]/20 transition hover:bg-[#15803d]"
        >
          Get Windows & Android App
        </a>

        <a
          href="#hero-console"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-xl border border-[#2a4c37] bg-[#132219]/80 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 transition hover:border-[#16a34a]/60 hover:bg-[#182c20] hover:text-white"
        >
          Explore Live Console
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Platform Support Indicators -->
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
        <span class="rounded-md border border-[#1f3627] bg-[#112017] px-2.5 py-1 text-slate-300">Windows Desktop Client</span>
        <span class="text-slate-600">•</span>
        <span class="rounded-md border border-[#1f3627] bg-[#112017] px-2.5 py-1 text-slate-300">Android Scanner</span>
        <span class="text-slate-600">•</span>
        <span class="rounded-md border border-[#1f3627] bg-[#112017] px-2.5 py-1 text-amber-400">100% Offline Campus LAN</span>
        <span class="text-slate-600">•</span>
        <span class="rounded-md border border-[#1f3627] bg-[#112017] px-2.5 py-1 text-[#4ade80]">SF10 / SF9 Registration</span>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Highlights Ticker: 4 Spotlight Minimalist Cards -->
    <div id="hero-features" class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      
      <!-- Feature 1: SF10 & SF9 Registration -->
      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#233e2e] bg-[#112017]/90 p-5 transition hover:border-[#16a34a] hover:bg-[#14261c]">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#4ade80]">01</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-400 font-semibold uppercase">Registration Method</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 font-display text-base font-bold text-white">SF-10 & SF-9 Registration</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          The efficient method to capture and register student basic profile information from official forms into the database.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Old Documents (2021 Onwards) -->
      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#233e2e] bg-[#112017]/90 p-5 transition hover:border-[#16a34a] hover:bg-[#14261c]">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#4ade80]">02</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#4ade80] font-semibold uppercase">Archival Scope</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 font-display text-base font-bold text-white">Old Documents 2021+</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Dedicated records management to digitize, organize, and search historical student archives dated 2021 onwards.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: OCR Text Scanner -->
      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#233e2e] bg-[#112017]/90 p-5 transition hover:border-[#16a34a] hover:bg-[#14261c]">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#4ade80]">03</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 font-semibold uppercase">Tesseract OCR</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 font-display text-base font-bold text-white">OCR Character Scanner</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Extracts learner identifiers and profile details directly from paper scans without tedious manual transcription.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4: Offline Campus LAN -->
      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#233e2e] bg-[#112017]/90 p-5 transition hover:border-[#16a34a] hover:bg-[#14261c]">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#4ade80]">04</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#38bdf8] font-semibold uppercase">Zero Cloud Risk</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 font-display text-base font-bold text-white">Campus LAN Database</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Fast SQLite storage running natively on school hardware in Tiaong, remaining 100% operational during internet outages.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Teacher Live Console Preview -->
    <div id="hero-console" class="mt-14 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#264332] bg-[#0c1610]/95 shadow-2xl shadow-black/80 backdrop-blur-xl">
      
      <!-- Top Titlebar matching TIS RMS Windows Application -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between border-b border-[#233e2e] bg-[#15803d] px-4 py-2.5 sm:px-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/tis_logo.png" alt="TIS Seal" class="h-6 w-6 object-contain" />
          <span class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-white tracking-wide">
            TIS Record Management System — Talisay Integrated School
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="rounded bg-black/20 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-emerald-100">
            S.Y. 2026-2027 Active
          </span>
          <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-1.5 ml-2">
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-300"></span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-white font-medium">Teacher Advisory Mode</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Secondary Navigation Bar inside Window - Minimalist Clean Tabs -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between border-b border-[#1f3627] bg-[#101e15] px-4 py-2.5 sm:px-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto pb-1 sm:pb-0">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-hero-tab="sf10"
            class="hero-tab-btn rounded-xl bg-[#16a34a] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition"
          >
            SF-10 & SF-9 Records
          </button>

          <button
            type="button"
            data-hero-tab="students"
            class="hero-tab-btn rounded-xl bg-[#16271c] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 border border-[#23412f] hover:bg-[#1a3023] hover:text-white transition"
          >
            Student Directory
          </button>

          <button
            type="button"
            data-hero-tab="docs"
            class="hero-tab-btn rounded-xl bg-[#16271c] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 border border-[#23412f] hover:bg-[#1a3023] hover:text-white transition"
          >
            Basic Info Registration
          </button>

          <button
            type="button"
            data-hero-tab="transparency"
            class="hero-tab-btn rounded-xl bg-[#16271c] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 border border-[#23412f] hover:bg-[#1a3023] hover:text-white transition"
          >
            Archive Overview (2021+)
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
          <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#22c55e]"></span>
          <span>Campus LAN Server Online</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab 1 Content: SF-10 / SF-9 Basic Information Register Preview -->
      <div id="hero-tab-content-sf10" class="hero-tab-content block p-5 sm:p-7">
        <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
          
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20">
              <span>Historical Document Ingestion (2021 Onwards)</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white sm:text-2xl">
              Basic Student Info from SF-10 & SF-9
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Using official SF-10 and SF-9 documents is the most efficient method to add and catalog student basic information from historical records dated 2021 onwards. The system manages student profiles and document archives without tracking subject grades.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-2 pt-1 text-xs text-slate-300">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#4ade80] font-bold">—</span>
                <span>Extracts 12-digit LRN, legal name, and birth records</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#4ade80] font-bold">—</span>
                <span>Registers historical academic year placement (2021+)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#4ade80] font-bold">—</span>
                <span>Basic information registration only (no grade tracking)</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-2">
              <a
                href="#school-forms"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#4ade80] hover:text-white transition"
              >
                <span>Explore Form Integration Details</span>
                <span>→</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Mock Interactive Basic Information Record Card (No Grades) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-7 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#23412f] bg-[#09110c] p-4 sm:p-5">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#1f3627] pb-3">
