                </div>
                <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-slate-300">
                  Cross-references student basic identifiers and school year records from historical files (2021 onwards).
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#0e1913] p-3 border border-[#1f3627] text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono">
                Scope: Basic registration of basic information only. No grade tracking or enrollment processing.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
